We are currently fighting here.

167
00:13:52,016 --> 00:13:55,016
おお。
Oh.

168
00:13:55,016 --> 00:13:59,016
イナ先輩、ARK初めてですか？
Ina-senpai, is this your first time playing ARK?

169
00:13:59,016 --> 00:14:02,016
初めてです。
It's my first time.

170
00:14:02,016 --> 00:14:07,016
オッケー。じゃあ、イナ先輩に、ちょっと待って。
Okay. Then, for Ina-senpai, wait a moment.

171
00:14:07,016 --> 00:14:13,016
移動しよう。死んだとこわかんない。
Let's move. I don't know where I died.

172
00:14:13,016 --> 00:14:16,016
